# 9. MOBILE-FIRST REQUIREMENT

The entire website MUST be mobile-first.

Never design desktop first and patch mobile later.

Base styles must represent the mobile experience.

Then progressively enhance for:

* Tablet
* Laptop
* Desktop
* Large desktop

The mobile experience must be intentionally designed.

Never rely on:

* hover-only behavior
* desktop-only interactions
* tiny controls
* horizontal scrolling
* desktop layouts squeezed into mobile

Test at:

320px
360px
375px
390px
414px
768px
1024px
1280px
1440px
1920px

Also test intermediate widths.

