# 19. METRIC UPDATES

Metrics must be designed for future updates.

For example:

```ts
{
  id: "dfc-zoom-delivery",
  value: "161 MB",
  label: "Base delivery reduction",
  status: "verified",
  project: "dfc-app"
}
```

Another:

```ts
{
  id: "dfc-bundle-optimization",
  previous: "21.02 MB",
  current: "15 MB",
  reduction: "6.02 MB",
  percentage: "28.6%",
  status: "verified"
}
```

If future verified results change:

* edit content
* do not edit UI

The same source should power:

* hero metrics
* impact dashboard
* project pages
* timelines
* achievement cards

Avoid duplicating the same metric in multiple files unless necessary.

